<title>JORDAN: JORDAN AVERAGE DINAR O/NITE RATES DROP TO 6.46 PCT.</title>
<headline>JORDAN AVERAGE DINAR O/NITE RATES DROP TO 6.46 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-08-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar fell to 6.46 percent on Saturday from 6.96 percent on Thursday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said three banks traded in three reported transactions worth 6 million dinars ($8.5 million) in deals concluded in a 6 percent- 7 percent range.</p>
<p>$1 = 0.709 dinars</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
</text>
